##########Final Log:{"Question": {"task": "A train running between two stations A and B arrives at its destination 10 minutes late when its speed is 50 km/h and 50 minutes late when its speed is 30 km/h. What is the distance between the stations A and B ? Choices: A)40 km B)50 km C)60 km D)70 km E)None of these", "step": "Let the distance between the two stations be x km.\nThen, x\u204450 - 10\u204460 = x\u204430 - 50\u204460\n\u21d2 x\u204450 - 1\u20446 = x\u204430 - 5\u20446\nor x\u204430 - x\u204450 = 2\u20443 or x = 50 km\nAnswer B", "answer": "B"}, "Answer": "B", "Step": "Let the salaries of A and B be 9x and 4x.\n9x \u00d7 115\u2044100 = 5175\n\\ x = 500\n\\ salary of B = 500 \u00d7 4 = 2000\nAnswer A", "Response": ["W"], "Attempt answer": "W", "Solved": false, "Total solved": 34, "Total executed": 62, "Accuracy": 0.5483870967741935}
