##########Final Log:{"Question": {"task": "The volume of a wall, 5 times as high as it is broad and 8 times as long as it is high, is 12.8 cubic meters. Find the breadth of the wall. Choices: A)40cm B)30cm C)20cm D)10cm E)None of these", "step": "Let the breadth of the wall be x metres.\nThen, Height = 5x metres and Length = 40x metres.\nx * 5x * 40x = 12.8\n=> x3 = 12.8/200 = 128/2000 = 64/1000\n=> x = 4/10 m\n=> x = (4/10) \u00d7 100 = 40 cm\nAnswer: A", "answer": "A"}, "Answer": "A", "Step": "p+tax = 106%\nPrice = 1060/106 * 100 = 1000\n105% = 1050\nShe will be saving 10 dollars.", "Response": ["A"], "Attempt answer": "A", "Solved": true, "Total solved": 59, "Total executed": 111, "Accuracy": 0.5315315315315315}
##########Final Log:{"Question": {"task": "A car travels at a speed of x kilometers per p hours. How many meters will it travel in s seconds, in terms of s, p and x. (xps \u2260 0; 1 kilometer = 1000 meters)? Choices: A)sx/(3.6p) B)1000xp/s C)xp/s D)60xp/s E)xp3.6*10^s", "step": "Distance travelled = (1000*x) metres\nTime taken = s seconds = (p*3600) seconds\nTherefore 1 sec = (3600p)/s\nSpeed in metres/sec = (1000x)/(3600p/s) = (sx/3.6p)\nAnswer: A", "answer": "A"}, "Answer": "A", "Step": "p+tax = 106%\nPrice = 1060/106 * 100 = 1000\n105% = 1050\nShe will be saving 10 dollars.", "Response": ["D"], "Attempt answer": "D", "Solved": false, "Total solved": 59, "Total executed": 112, "Accuracy": 0.5267857142857143}
##########Final Log:{"Question": {"task": "Anil invests an amount for 2 years at the rate of 15% per annum at simple interest.Had he invested in a scheme in which interest was compounded yearly he would have got Rs.450 more. Find the principal Choices: A)Rs.8,000 B)Rs.15,000 C)Rs.20,000 D)Rs.10,000 E)Rs.30,000", "step": "Difference D between compound and simple interest for 2 years,\nD=P*(R/100)^2\nwhere P is the principal\nR is rate of interest\nso here,\n450=P*(0.15)^2\n=> P=20000\nANSWER:C", "answer": "C"}, "Answer": "C", "Step": "p+tax = 106%\nPrice = 1060/106 * 100 = 1000\n105% = 1050\nShe will be saving 10 dollars.", "Response": ["C"], "Attempt answer": "C", "Solved": true, "Total solved": 60, "Total executed": 113, "Accuracy": 0.5309734513274337}
